 manpowerNote: '<strong>Oct 7 crews stated by front: GreenSol 23 — 4 terminations, 5 grounding, 5 commissioning, 1 megger, 6 excavation, 2 conduit. A second document reports 10 people on the INV-11/12 fronts; the two are NOT summed because they may count the same people. ECCS filed no quantified production and United stated no crew.</strong> <strong>Oct 6 crews stated: GreenSol 13 (support crews only), ITS 5; ECCS and United not stated.</strong> <strong>Oct 5 (Monday) crews stated: GreenSol 29, Topland 2, ITS 5; ECCS and United not stated. Oct 6: all-hands toolbox talk with every crew on site.</strong> <strong>No EHS headcount board since Sep 17 (202 on site) — requested again Sep 28, Excel promised, not received.</strong> Crews stated in the daily reports: Sep 29 United mechanical 25, GreenSol 35 assignments; Sep 30 United mechanical 27, GreenSol 23; Oct 1 ECCS 26 reported / 16 in the field after 8:00 rain, United mechanical 6; Oct 2 GreenSol 25 + 1 supervisor, ITS 7. United electrical and ECCS are not stated on most days, so no site total is published for these days.',

